==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|под-|хвати́ть}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|подхвати́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-подхватить.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|подхвати́ть|pf|impf=подхва́тывать}}

# to [[catch]] (up), to [[pick up]], to grasp, to snatch
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to catch, to pick up (a disease)
# to pick up (an expression, a song)
# to join in, to take up, to catch up
#* {{quote-book|ru|year=1905|author=w:ru:Фёдор Сологуб<t:{{w|Fyodor Sologub}}>
|title=w:ru:Мелкий бес|chapter=VIII|location=|publisher=|newversion=English translation from|translator2=John Cournos and Richard Aldington|title2=w:en:[[The Petty Demon|The Little Demon]]|location2=New York|publisher2=w:en:Alfred A. Knopf|year2=1916|page2=|pageurl2=
|text=Верну́вшись к Тишко́ву, Скуча́ев сказа́л:<br>— Зря болта́ют на челове́ка.<br>— Зря болта́ют, пра́вды не зна́ют, — то́тчас же '''подхвати́л''' Тишко́в, молодцева́то налива́я себе́ рю́мку англи́йской го́рькой.|t=When he returned to Tishkov, Skouchayev said :<br>" They gossip about that youth."<br>" They may gossip about that youth, but they don't know the truth," Tishkov '''caught''' him '''up''' immediately, deftly pouring himself a glass of English bitter.}}

